    <headline>ALERT: immunisation coverage falling in Rukungiri District</headline>
    <description>Three-month Penta1 coverage is 60%; about 3,367 children in the last 12 months have received no Penta1 dose. Trigger: coverage falling below district baseline (CUSUM 26.9). SIMULATED DATA - EXERCISE.</description>
    <instruction>District Health Team to verify vaccine stock and session reports, and plan catch-up outreach for unreached parishes.</instruction>
